{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35882","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 十 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壮气虽同德不同，项王何似王江东。\n乡歌寂寂荒丘月，渔艇年年古渡风。\n难世斯人犹不达，此时吾道岂能通。\n吟君十首山中作，方觉多端总是空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}